          "docs": "Delete a domain using an asynchronous long-running operation. Before performing this operation, you must update or remove any references to Exchange as the provisioning service. The following actions are performed as part of this operation: After the domain deletion completes, API operations for the deleted domain return an HTTP 404 status code. To verify deletion of a domain, you can perform a get domain operation."
